  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひこう　そくどは　じそく２００キロ。\nドラメシヤと　いっしょに　たたかい\nぶじに　しんかするまで　せわをする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "비행 속도는 시속 200km.\n드라꼰과 함께 싸우며\n무사히 진화할 때까지 돌본다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "飛行速度為每小時２００公里。\n與多龍梅西亞一起戰鬥，\n到牠進化為止都會細心照顧。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vole à une vitesse de 200 km/h et se bat\naux côtés d’un Fantyrm, dont il prend soin\njusqu’à son évolution.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Beim Fliegen ist es bis zu 200 km/h schnell. Es\nkämpft gemeinsam mit Grolldra und kümmert\nsich bis zu dessen Entwicklung um es.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vuela a una velocidad de 200 km/h. Lucha junto\na un Dreepy, al que cuida hasta el momento de\nsu evolución.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vola a una velocità di 200 km/h. Lotta assieme\na Dreepy e se ne prende cura fino a quando\nnon si evolve.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s capable of flying faster than 120 mph.\nIt battles alongside Dreepy and\ndotes on them until they successfully evolve.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "飛行速度は　時速２００キロ。\nドラメシヤと　いっしょに　戦い\n無事に　進化するまで　世話をする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "飞行速度为每小时２００公里。\n与多龙梅西亚一起战斗，\n到它进化为止都会细心照顾。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vuela a una velocidad de 200 km/h. Lucha junto\na un Dreepy, al que cuida hasta el momento de\nsu evolución.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せわをする　ドラメシヤを　あたまに\nのせていないと　おちつかないので\nほかの　ポケモンを　のせようとする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "보살피는 드라꼰을 머리에\n태우지 않으면 진정하지 못하고\n다른 포켓몬을 태우려고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "要是沒讓自己在照顧的多龍梅西亞\n乘在頭上就靜不下心來，甚至會\n因此試圖把別的寶可夢放到頭上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il prend soin du Fantyrm sur sa tête.\nQuand ce dernier n’est plus là, il panique\net tente de le remplacer par un autre Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hat es kein Grolldra auf seinem Kopf, auf das es\naufpassen kann, wird es nervös. Dann versucht es,\nein anderes Pokémon auf seinen Kopf zu setzen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si no lleva un Dreepy del que cuidar encima de\nla cabeza, se intranquiliza y trata de sustituirlo\ncon otro Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se non ha un Dreepy sulla testa di cui prendersi\ncura, non riesce a stare tranquillo e cerca\ndi sostituirlo con altri Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Without a Dreepy to place on its head and\ncare for, it gets so uneasy it’ll try to substitute\nany Pokémon it finds for the missing Dreepy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "世話をする　ドラメシヤを　頭に\n乗せていないと　落ち着かないので\nほかの　ポケモンを　乗せようとする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "要是没让自己在照顾的多龙梅西亚\n乘在头上就静不下心来，甚至会\n因此试图把别的宝可梦放到头上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si no lleva un Dreepy del que cuidar encima de\nla cabeza, se intranquiliza y trata de sustituirlo\ncon otro Pokémon.",
      "language": {
